                      an integrated configuration program and auto-creates the
                      configuration.

V0.11  (05-25-96)  -  Small Update

                     -BUG-REPORT FROM RAMSES & PASO:
                      After downloading, DirDownloader reports an error, this
                      is not correct, only the wrong returnvalue was checked
                      resulting in the error. Now fixed for FAME V1.4.

